00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:00.033
Even take this, right?

00:04:00.033 --> 00:04:01.200
You're filming this.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.700
- [Woman] Yes, we brought them with us.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:03.533
- I see that.

00:04:03.533 --> 00:04:07.830
I see this as, in my
mind, in that free deck

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:08.840
