00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:10.300
The Gary Vee Content Model.

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:14.573
I see today right now
as 34 pieces of content.

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:17.350
- Easily.
- That's right.

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:18.610
That is the answer.
- Yeah.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:21.150
That is easily.
- I agree.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:22.790
The fact that you answered so easily,

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:24.520
that means you guys are halfway home.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.140
Now it's just execution

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:27.610
and maybe you're doing
that too, I don't know.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:31.280
But I can tell you that up
until I put out that deck,

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:34.080
until I started getting loud
about how I do the content,

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.590
a lot of podcasters, 99% of them, see this

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:37.720
