00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:38.700
- [Woman] Oh, no, it's
a lot more than that.

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:39.780
- Do you understand?
- Yeah.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:41.985
He pushes us over there to do it.

00:04:41.985 --> 00:04:42.850
To do even more.

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:43.900
- So the answer is more.

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:46.752
I mean, it's like how do
you get bigger muscles?

00:04:46.752 --> 00:04:48.564
You work out more.

00:04:48.564 --> 00:04:50.290
You know, how do you lose more fat?

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:51.360
You work out more.

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:53.490
How do you get your heart healthier?

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:55.127
You know?

00:04:55.127 --> 00:04:57.070
The answer is more.

00:04:57.070 --> 00:04:59.090
I was saying something to
Brandon, my best friend

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:00.197
who runs Wine Library now

00:05:00.197 --> 00:05:03.270
