00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:24.100
The one that you admire
and think is the best?

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:28.000
I currently, in my current
form as a businessman,

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:31.270
as a person, as a
father, a husband, a man,

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:35.860
I view that guy that
was me only a decade ago

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:38.290
