00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:48.310
I can't believe how much better I am today

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:50.270
than I was 10 years ago and I thought

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:52.630
I was the best 10 years ago.

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:54.750
You can imagine, one of the
things that I'm most proud of

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.670
