00:05:56.670 --> 00:06:00.040
Over the last 10 years,
I have become better.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.520
There's nothing else to say.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:02.850
I've become better.
- But how do you

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:04.490
