00:06:57.357 --> 00:06:59.610
You buy time.
- Very true.

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:02.500
- You buy time.
- Yeah, leveraging.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:05.240
- Correct, you buy time.
- That's exactly

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:06.120
what we did with them
coming with us, right?

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:07.670
- I see that, I see them.

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:09.010
- [Woman] Because it's kind
