00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:16.180
It's not about us number one,

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:18.590
it's about who we can bring
with us on the journey.

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:21.650
- That becomes a selfless
act that is selfish

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:23.020
