- Like to me, I genuinely get happiness

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.380
from other people getting happy

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:42.700
mainly because I'm pretty
emotionally fulfilled.

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:43.533
- Yes.
- Yes.

00:07:43.533 --> 00:07:45.560
